# Design system (follow for all UI)

Full reference: [`docs/design-system.md`](docs/design-system.md). Living gallery: `/design` (`src/pages/design.astro`). Tokens: `src/styles/tokens.css` (via `global.css`). Feature CSS: `hero.css`, `projects.css`, `testimonials.css`, `brands.css`, `skills.css`, `nav.css`, `utils.css`. Tools: `tools.css`. Gallery: `design.css`. Page scope: `site-root` + `--site-*` vars.

## Personality

Technical, craft-forward portfolio. Calm and precise — not loud SaaS marketing. Prefer matching existing section/element patterns over new visual languages.

**Avoid:** purple gradients, cream+terracotta editorial kits, broadsheet dense grids, glow stacks, emoji chrome, Inter/Roboto/Arial as display type, dashboard card grids on marketing surfaces.

## Layout

- Default content width: **`max-w-[550px]`** (home sections, footer, tools hub). Match footer when building hub-like pages.
- Tools author `~1100px`; markdown split `~1280px`.
- Breakpoint: `max-narrow:` ≤609px (`--breakpoint-narrow: 610px`).
- One job per section: one headline + one short muted support line.
- Top padding under nav ≈ `110–120px`.

## Color (semantic only)

Use `bg-bg`, `text-text`, `bg-surface`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`, `bg-inactive`, `text-text/60` (and `/50`–`/40` for meta). Primary `#2a29ff` and accent/active stay across themes; surfaces flip in `.dark`.

Borders: `border-border` or `shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--color-border)]`. Minimal drop shadows (nav glass is the exception — `.nav-glass` in `nav.css`; mount from BaseLayout; no `transform` / `view-transition-name` / same-node `overflow: hidden` on glass).

## Type

- **Manrope 600** (`font-manrope`) for UI/marketing. Tracking ≈ `-0.04em` (titles `-0.05em`).
- **Fragment Mono** for code / raw markdown only.
- Scale: hero `70→48`, section `50→34`, body/CTA `17→15`, meta `13–14→12–13`. Text usually `m-0 p-0`.

## Shape

- Interactive chrome → **`rounded-full`** (CTAs, nav, search).
- Soft shells → `rounded-[45px]/[46px]` (mobile `[36px]`).
- Utility form fields → `14px` radius unless search (pill).
- Prefer surface shells + rows over generic cards. Cards only when wrapping a clear interaction (e.g. tools hub links).

## Recipes to copy

- **CSS home:** page content under `site-root`; feature sheets via `global.css` (`tokens`, `hero`, `projects`, …); `--site-*` for layout helpers. Tools/gallery stay page-scoped. Nav chrome lives in `BaseLayout` (not per-page).
- **Back control:** 52px circle + “Back to …” label (see blog/project/tools shell) — not plain “← text”.
- **Primary CTA:** pill, primary fill, optional scramble (`data-scramble`).
- **Home / 404 / Project / Blog:** `/design` mounts live sections/pages with `preview` + dummy copy (`src/utils/design-preview-data.ts`).
- **Project:** sticky media cards (not blog list shell); metadata rows; links bar; privacy page type.
- **Blog article:** left H1 + meta row + hairline + intro; body scale 38/22/18; disc/labeled/numbered bullets; `BlogCodeBlock` for fenced code; inline View all.
- **Markdown docs:** `data-md-doc="<id>"` + `MarkdownDocPanel`; optional `.md-doc-trigger`.
- **Tools:** register in `src/utils/tools.ts`; use `ToolsPageShell`; nested scroll → `data-lenis-prevent`.
- **Search:** `type="text"` + custom clear button (no native search cancel).
- **Private tools:** `noindex={true}`.
- **Gallery:** living previews at `/design`.

## Motion

Lenis page scroll; scramble on key CTAs; short `200ms` hovers; optional `appear-*` / reveal. Don’t add motion noise. Honor reduced motion.

**Enhancements:** **Adopt Motion (JS)** (OSS `motion`) as the animation runtime. Use it for **scroll reveal** (`inView`, §12.2.2), **spring physics** (§12.2.3), and optional **circular custom cursor** (§12.2.4). **Verify Lenis vs native scroll** before locking the stack (§12.2.5). Prefer native View Transitions for page morphs. Replace custom scramble with Motion+ [`scrambleText`](https://motion.dev/examples/js-scramble-text) (§12.2.1) only with a membership. Keep at most one smooth-scroll approach; no GSAP theatre.
